content.text:
Wait, `#btn-mirror` has class `mirror-btn` but also ghost; when I add `mirror-btn{display:none}` it may conflict with `.btn` display. In media query display:inline-flex overrides. Good.

Now core.js: utilities, RNG, input, audio, event helpers.

Input design:
```js
export class Input {
  constructor(target) {
    this.keys = new Set();
    this.pressed = new Set();
    this.mouse = { x:0, y:0, down:false, active:false, lastMove:-1e9 };
    this.touch = { x:0,y:0, moving:false, attack:false, aim:null };
    this._bind(target)
  }
}
```
Keyboard: on keydown, if not repeat, pressed.add(code); prevent default for space/arrows. Escape handled via app.

Pointer: pointermove on window sets mouse pos (CSS pixels) and active; pointerdown/up left. For touch, main handles joystick/buttons separately (DOM). So mouse only when pointerType==='mouse'.

`endFrame()` clears pressed after update.

Just pressed checks: `wasPressed(code)`.

Audio: implement generative sounds. Let's write carefully:

```js
export class AudioKit {
  constructor(){ this.ready=false; this.enabled = stored; this.ctx=null }
  init(){ if(this.ctx) return; const AC=window.AudioContext||window.webkitAudioContext; if(!AC)return; ... master gain .5, compressor; ambient }
  resume()
  toggle()
  tone({freq, freqEnd, dur, type, gain, attack, release, pan})
  noise({dur, gain, filterType, freq, q, sweep})
  sfx(name)
}
```
Ambient: create buffer noise loop (2s) through bandpass low freq + gain 0.02; drone oscillators detuned (55, 82.4, 110 Hz) with LFO gain. Keep subtle and only during gameplay? It's fine always after gesture.

SFX list: slash (noise highpass sweep down + tone), hit (short square thud + noise), hurt (saw down), dash (noise bandpass sweep up), kill (low boom), pickup (sine high ping), boon (chime triad), gate (low whoosh), boss (sawtooth roar), win (arpeggio), lose (minor drone descend), shield (bell), heal.

Avoid overlapping too many; fine.

Also `rng` and `hash`. `shadeColor` maybe in art.

Write core.js.

